Hi, 
Thanks for playing and for your feedback!

We've just released an update with some improvements:
- Smoother card movements;
- Improved response click and double-click;
- Separate volume options for Music, SFX, and Environment sounds;
- Menu to navigate directly to another scenario;
- New options: Mouse sensitivity for camera control, VSync;
- Improved visuals in some scenes;
- and some other details.

We hope you enjoy it!
